/tmp/LMCache-prior/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/cli/bench.po:1331:" -- this means ``lookup`` and ``load`` will almost always observe the "
/tmp/LMCache-prior/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/cli/bench.po:1332:"data that ``store`` just wrote still hot in RAM, and the reported numbers"
/tmp/LMCache-prior/docs/source/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/cli/bench.po:1334:msgstr "当未给出 ``--only`` 时，这三个操作将在 **单个进程中按顺序** 执行 ``store -> lookup -> load``。对于其后端存储位于操作系统级缓存之后的适配器——尤其是本地文件系统（``fs``）适配器，它受 Linux **页面缓存** 的影响——这意味着 ``lookup`` 和 ``load`` 几乎总是会观察到 ``store`` 刚刚写入的数据仍然在 RAM 中热存储，报告的数字反映的是页面缓存的吞吐量，而不是底层设备的吞吐量。"
